<title>USA: Alexander's Inc Q4 net profits increase.</title>
<headline>Alexander's Inc Q4 net profits increase.</headline>
<dateline>SADDLE BROOK, N.J. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr	 profit   $2.83	  profit  $1.82</p>
<p>Continuing operations per</p>
<p>    shr    profit   $2.83	     loss $0.21</p>
<p>Continuing operations</p>
<p>	     profit  14,136	   loss   1,066</p>
<p> Net	 profit  14,136	  profit  9,067</p>
<p> Revs		   6,084		    4,141</p>
<p> Avg shrs	     5,001		    5,001</p>
<p>	     year</p>
<p> Shr	 profit   $4.94	  profit  $0.49</p>
<p>Continuing operations per</p>
<p>    shr    profit   $2.62	     loss $1.54</p>
<p>Continuing operations</p>
<p>	     profit  13,097	   loss   7,696</p>
<p> Net	 profit  24,699	profit    2,437</p>
<p> Revs		  21,833		   14,761</p>
<p> Avg shrs	     5,001		    5,001</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for the fourth quarter and fiscal year 1996 includes a gain of $14,372,000, or $2.87 per share, on a reversal of a liability.</p>
<p>Net income for fiscal year 1995 includes reorganizaiton expenses of $1.9 million which was partly offset by an income tax benefit of $1.4 million.</p>
